ottie files are scalable, resolution-independent, and significantly smaller in size, ensuring faster loading times and smoother performance. Lottie animations are ideal for businesses looking to add dynamic visuals to their digital products without compromising performance. Whether it’s micro-interactions, onboarding sequences, or animated icons, Lottie makes high-quality animation accessible and efficient.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What tools do you use for Lottie animations?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"What tools do you use for Lottie animations?\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Why is Lottie animation important?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Lottie animation is important because it enhances user engagement, improves UX, and keeps your design visually appealing without sacrificing performance. Its lightweight nature ensures fast loading times, even on slow connections, while its compatibility across web and mobile platforms makes it a versatile choice for modern digital experiences.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How much do you charge?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"We offer 2 kinds of plans for your budget. Additionally, we offer a package deal for Lottie Animations. Visit our pricing page to learn more or contact us for more details.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"I am still not sure if this is right for me, can we discuss it first?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes, absolutely. Feel free to book a consultation to discuss your project further. We will contact you to set up an ideal time and are more than happy to answer your questions.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"VideoObject\",\n  \"name\": \"Motion The Agency | Lottie Sizzle Reel | 2025\",\n  \"description\": \"Motion The Agency – 2025 Lottie Animation Reel We turn ideas into interactive experiences—fueling creativity that makes brands come alive! This year, we’ve refined our craft, focusing on sleek, lightweight Lottie UI animations that enhance user experiences while keeping things fast and engagin…\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YtX455s8kMs/maxresdefault.jpg\",\n  \"uploadDate\": \"2025-05-27T05:30:45-07:00\",\n  \"duration\": \"PT30S\",\n  \"embedUrl\": \"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YtX455s8kMs\",\n  \"contentUrl\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YtX455s8kMs\",\n  \"publisher\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"Motion The Agency\",\n    \"logo\": {\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n      \"url\": \"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66ebfb6ec8f20d5eda50eb34/6762c1dea24d4f98491f457f_Logo.png\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Engaging Lottie Animations for Websites and Mobile Apps\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Level up your UX with Lottie animations that are light, interactive, and built to convert. Perfect for web, mobile, and digital products.\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66ebfb6ec8f20d5eda50eb34/670cc171a0c8c36348181481_UI%20Animation%20Thumbnail.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">",
    "bodyEnd": "\n<!--  Slick Slider JS  -->\n  <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/slick-carousel@1.8.1/slick/slick.min.js\"></script>\n  <!--  Card Slider Config  -->\n  <script>\n    $(document).ready(function() {\n        //-------- Filter functionality ----------\n        // Add class name of category slug to each slider item\n        $('.card-slider_item').addClass(function() {\n            return $(this).find('.card-category_slug').text() //class of element hidden in slider collection with category slug\n        });\n        // When you click a dropdown link, filter the slider\n        $(\".dropdown-link\").click(function() {\n            if ($(this).hasClass(\"cc-selected\")) { //if the dropdown link is already selected, unselect and unfilter the slider\n                $(\"#cms-slider\").slick('slickUnfilter');\n                $(this).removeClass(\"cc-selected\");\n            } else { //if the dropdown link isn't selected, add selected class and filter the slider\n                $(\".dropdown-link\").removeClass(\"cc-selected\");\n                $(this).addClass(\"cc-selected\");\n                var filter = $(this).find('.dropdown-link_slug').text(); //class of element hidden in dropdown link with category slug\n                var filterClass = '.' + filter; //add '.' before slug name to associate it as a class\n                $(\"#cms-slider\").slick('slickUnfilter'); //clear previous filter on slider\n                $(\"#cms-slider\").slick('slickFilter', filterClass); //filter the slider by the selected dropdown link's slug\n            }\n        });\n        //-------- Configure slider ----------\n        $('#cms-slider').slick({\n            arrows: false,\n            infinite: false,\n            autoplay: false,\n            autoplaySpeed: 8000,\n            speed: 300,\n            slidesToShow: 3,\n            slidesToScroll: 1,\n            responsive: [{\n                    breakpoint: 1024,\n                    settings: {\n                        slidesToShow: 2\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    breakpoint: 768,\n                    settings: {\n                        slidesToShow: 1\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        });\n        //--------- Set custom nav ---------\n        $('#cms-slider-right').click(function() {\n            $('#cms-slider').slick('slickNext');\n        });\n        $('#cms-slider-left').click(function() {\n            $('#cms-slider').slick('slickPrev');\n        });\n    });\n</script>\n  ",
    "bodyStart": "<script>document.body.className=\"body\";</script>"
  }
